      {
        "id": "model-build-heap-order",
        "moduleId": "heap-adjust-build",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "补充解释：为什么从 $\\lfloor n/2 \\rfloor$ 开始",
        "markdown": "在完全二叉树中，编号大于 $\\lfloor n/2 \\rfloor$ 的结点都没有孩子，它们本身就是合法的堆。从后向前处理时，当筛选某个结点，它的左右子树已经被处理成堆，因此一次自上而下的筛选就足以让以该结点为根的子树重新成为堆。\n\n若从根开始向前处理，子树尚未调整好，筛选结果就不可靠。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-build-heap"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-heap-adjust-code",
        "moduleId": "heap-adjust-build",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "code",
        "title": "筛选算法 HeapAdjust",
        "markdown": "教材的筛选算法 `HeapAdjust` 把待调整记录暂存在 `rc` 中，然后沿关键字较大的孩子结点向下筛选：\n\n```c\nvoid HeapAdjust(HeapType &H, int s, int m) {\n  rc = H.r[s];\n  for (j = 2 * s; j <= m; j *= 2) {\n    if (j < m && LT(H.r[j].key, H.r[j + 1].key)) ++j;\n    if (!LT(rc.key, H.r[j].key)) break;\n    H.r[s] = H.r[j];\n    s = j;\n  }\n  H.r[s] = rc;\n}\n```\n\n循环中 `j = 2 * s` 定位左孩子，`j *= 2` 表示继续向下一层；`rc` 暂存使记录只在最后落位一次，从而减少移动。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-6ea5f19a3c614ba8cee7df46",
